topic: ohos-elf-resign-after-meson-install
symptom: Installed dosbox returns Error 126 Operation not permitted after upstream 24/24
root_cause: Meson install can rewrite final ELF bytes while a pre-install codesign section remains, and the helper trusted any single existing section
fix: Force-remove and re-sign the installed package ELF after Meson install while retaining the validated fast path for build/test ELFs
validation: r52 diagnosis plus local force-resign regression and r67 OHOS upstream 24/24 with installed-package flow 1/1 on HEAD 226472fc71c00d0d73a2a5604665fce3fda8e02b
